Error: Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed: `values` cannot be passed with write access while `window` is still looking into it
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/method_write_argument_conflicts_with_live_view_once.jet:11:18
    |
 11 |     editor.touch(values)
    |                  ^^^^^^
 Why: `window` is a live read view into `values[…]`; changing or moving the owner could invalidate that view
 Fix: Finish using `window` before changing `values`, narrow the view's scope, or make an owned copy
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.OwnerMovedWhileViewed
